courses.learning_outcomes:
The course will

* help students grasp the nature of SNS with an overview of its influence in public affairs, especially to policy makers and influencers;
* enhance students' understanding of the new era of news media under the influence of SNS as a dominating form of medium;
* encourage students to academically discuss the analytical framework and real-life applications of social listening as a new means to understand “public opinion”; and
* enable students to, in the shoes of a Public Relations practitioner, use SNS to their advantage in fulfilling different objectives and goals through sharing of industry experience.

